# Backend Rules

- Business rules belong server-side.
- Validate all request inputs.
- Use typed domain boundaries.
- Keep controllers/routes thin.
- Separate persistence from business logic.
- Enforce authorization before sensitive operations.
- Use transactions for operations requiring atomicity.
- Use idempotency for retryable financial operations.
- Return safe errors to clients.
- Do not expose database internals.
- Add tests for critical business rules.
